lds of it:"}]},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"its ","type":"text"},{"code":"EventRecord\/id","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"code":"EventRecord\/isRedelivered","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":";","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"its ","type":"text"},{"code":"EventRecord\/timestamp","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", to the millisecond the body holds;","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"its event, a value of the decoder’s type of that ","type":"text"},{"code":"Event\/name","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and version, read through the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"type’s schema in ","type":"text"},{"code":"plan","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", its ","type":"text"},{"code":"Sensitive","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" values included;","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"the context the body’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"context"},{"type":"text","text":" holds: the session’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SessionKey"},{"type":"text","text":", the sample rate, the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"standard context keys, and the trace context, which the decoder’s instrument extracts."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A record has no ","type":"text"},{"code":"EventRecord\/sourceLocation","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" or ","type":"text"},{"code":"EventRecord\/deliveryTag","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", which the body","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"doesn’t hold, and it reveals its sensitive values, as a tracked record does, so a destination","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"made with ","type":"text"},{"code":"redactingSensitiveValues()","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" still redacts them. Encoding the records again with a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/CollectorEncoding\/documentation\/CollectorEncoding\/CollectorBatchEncoder","type":"reference"},{"text":" of the same plan, and an instrument that injects what it extracts,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"writes the same bytes.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Each record is read at the version its ","type":"text"},{"code":"version","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" member states, into the decoder’s type of","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"that name and version, through the plan’s schema of both. A server that reads the batches of","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"several releases of an app is given a type of each version they send. It declares the earlier","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"versions in a ","type":"text"},{"code":"private","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" or ","type":"text"},{"code":"fileprivate","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" scope, where ","type":"text"},{"code":"@Event","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" lets a second type of one name","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"build, and a plan made from the same types holds a schema of each. That scope is a file-scope","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"private","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" type or a ","type":"text"},{"code":"fileprivate","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" one, not a ","type":"text"},{"code":"private","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" member of another type","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/tyler-keith-thompson.github.io\/Traffluent\/documentation\/traffluent\/definingevents","isActive":true},{"text":").","type":"text"}]},{"syntax":"swift","code":["@Event(name: \"checkout_started\", version: 2)","struct CheckoutStarted {","    var items: Int","    var currency: String","}","","\/\/ Version 1, which releases still installed send.","private enum EarlierVersions {","    @Event(name: \"checkout_started\")","    struct CheckoutStarted {","        var items: Int","    }","}","","let decoder = try CollectorBatchDecoder(plan: try TrackingPlan())"],"type":"codeListing"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A record without a "},{"code":"version","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" member, as releases before the member was written send, is read"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"at version 1 when the decoder has a type and the plan a schema of its event at 1, and otherwise"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"at the lowest version it has both of. Those releases sent version 1 unless an event declared"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"another. A record one of them sent at a raised version is read at version 1 too when the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"decoder has version 1: it is reported as"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/CollectorEncoding\/documentation\/CollectorEncoding\/CollectorDecodingError\/undecodableProperty(event:property:)","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" when its properties don’t fit"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"that type, and read as version 1 when they do."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A record the decoder can’t read is left out and the batch’s other records are read: one whose"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"event it has no type of, one at a version it has no type of or the plan no schema of, a member"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"that is missing or holds what the encoder never writes, and a property the event’s type can’t read"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/CollectorEncoding\/documentation\/CollectorEncoding\/CollectorDecodingError"},{"type":"text","text":"). "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/CollectorEncoding\/documentation\/CollectorEncoding\/CollectorBatchDecoder\/batch(from:)"},{"type":"text","text":" returns each as an "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/CollectorEncoding\/documentation\/CollectorEncoding\/UndecodedRecord"},{"type":"text","text":". A"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"Sensitive","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" property a delivery redacted is missing, so its record reads back only when the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"property is optional or has a default value; a redacted "},{"code":"Sensitive","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" element of an array is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"null","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", so a record whose array of non-optional "},{"code":"Sensitive","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" elements was redacted is reported as"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/CollectorEncoding\/documentation\/CollectorEncoding\/CollectorDecodingError\/undecodableProperty(event:property:)"},{"type":"text","text":". An integer outside its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"property’s type, such as 300 for a "},{"code":"UInt8","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", is reported the same way. A property of a type the plan can’t map reads"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"back only as far as its JSON holds what its "},{"code":"Decodable","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" conformance reads: a whole "},{"code":"Double","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"inside it is written without a fraction, and a "},{"code":"Date","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" inside it as a timestamp, neither of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"which it reads."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A body that isn’t a collector batch at all t